<title>USA: Scottsdale Preserve Auth., Ariz., won by Smith.</title>
<headline>Scottsdale Preserve Auth., Ariz., won by Smith.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc. said it won $20.500 million of Scottsdale Preserve Authority, Ariz., excise tax revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.73 percent.</p>
</text>
